WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.748 line:88%
Assalomu alaykum! Men Aziz — ofitsiantman.
Bugun xizmat siklini ko‘rib chiqamiz.

2
00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:11.947 line:88%
Mehmon restoranga taassurot uchun
keladi. Uni esa biz yaratamiz.

3
00:00:13.297 --> 00:00:18.276 line:88%
Mehmon sizni eshitishdan oldin
ko‘radi: forma toza, beyj joyida.

4
00:00:18.496 --> 00:00:22.869 line:88%
Tirnoqlar kalta va toza.
Uzuk va bilaguzuk taqilmaydi.

5
00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:26.189 line:88%
Poyabzal yopiq va sirpanmaydigan.

6
00:00:26.409 --> 00:00:29.569 line:88%
Telefon va saqich zalga chiqmaydi.

7
00:00:30.919 --> 00:00:35.656 line:88%
Smena brifingdan boshlanadi:
bugungi bronlar e’lon qilinadi.

8
00:00:35.876 --> 00:00:39.582 line:88%
Stop-list — bugun tugagan taomlar ro‘yxati.

9
00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:43.811 line:88%
Kun taomi, bo‘limlar
taqsimoti va smena maqsadi.

10
00:00:44.031 --> 00:00:48.282 line:88%
Savolingizni shu yerda
so‘rang — mehmon oldida emas.

11
00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:55.035 line:88%
Xizmat sikli — o‘n qadam: kutib olish,
joylashtirish, ichimlik taklifi.

12
00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:58.719 line:88%
Buyurtma, taomni uzatish va tekshirish.

13
00:00:58.939 --> 00:01:03.069 line:88%
Stolni kuzatish, desert,
hisob va kuzatib qo‘yish.

14
00:01:03.289 --> 00:01:06.935 line:88%
Tartib buzilsa, mehmon buni darhol sezadi.

15
00:01:08.285 --> 00:01:12.658 line:88%
Mehmon kirdi — uni o‘ttiz
soniya ichida payqash shart.

16
00:01:12.878 --> 00:01:17.068 line:88%
Band bo‘lsangiz ham — ko‘z
bilan aloqa va tabassum.

17
00:01:17.288 --> 00:01:21.479 line:88%
Keyin salom bering va bron
bor-yo‘qligini aniqlang.

18
00:01:22.829 --> 00:01:27.142 line:88%
Birinchi vaziyat: mehmon
stolni oldindan band qilgan.

19
00:01:27.362 --> 00:01:31.795 line:88%
— Assalomu alaykum, xush
kelibsiz! Stol band qilganmisiz?

20
00:01:32.015 --> 00:01:35.115 line:88%
— Ha, Karimov nomiga, soat yettiga.

21
00:01:35.335 --> 00:01:40.192 line:88%
— Janob Karimov, to‘rt kishilik
stol, deraza yonida — to‘g‘rimi?

22
00:01:40.412 --> 00:01:42.812 line:88%
— To‘g‘ri.

23
00:01:43.032 --> 00:01:47.587 line:88%
Bron ovoz chiqarib tasdiqlandi:
ism, vaqt, kishilar soni.

24
00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:52.362 line:88%
— Bolalar stuli ham joyida.
Marhamat, men kuzatib qo‘yaman.

25
00:01:52.582 --> 00:01:57.318 line:88%
Maxsus so‘rovni ofitsiantning
o‘zi eslatdi. Bron — bu va’da.

26
00:01:58.668 --> 00:02:02.980 line:88%
Ikkinchi vaziyat: mehmon
bronsiz keldi, stollar band.

27
00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.209 line:88%
— Assalomu alaykum, xush
kelibsiz! Necha kishisiz?

28
00:02:07.429 --> 00:02:10.468 line:88%
— Ikki kishimiz, bron qilmagandik.

29
00:02:10.688 --> 00:02:15.061 line:88%
«Joy yo‘q» demang. Halol
vaqt ayting va tanlov bering.

30
00:02:15.281 --> 00:02:20.927 line:88%
— Stol 15–20 daqiqada bo‘shaydi. Kutish
joyida o‘tirsangiz, o‘zim chaqiraman.

31
00:02:21.147 --> 00:02:23.547 line:88%
— Mayli, kutamiz.

32
00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:27.412 line:88%
Kam va’da bering — ortig‘i bilan bajaring.

33
00:02:28.762 --> 00:02:32.832 line:88%
Stolni barmoq bilan
ko‘rsatmang — kuzatib boring.

34
00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:37.182 line:88%
Stulni tortib bering: avval
ayollar va keksalarga.

35
00:02:37.402 --> 00:02:41.714 line:88%
Menyuni ochiq holda, har
bir mehmonga alohida bering.

36
00:02:41.934 --> 00:02:46.065 line:88%
O‘zingizni tanishtiring
va ichimlik taklif qiling.

37
00:02:47.415 --> 00:02:51.363 line:88%
Taom uzatilgach, ikki
daqiqa ichida tekshiring.

38
00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:55.774 line:88%
«Taom ma’qul bo‘ldimi?»
Muammo shu payt tuzatiladi.

39
00:02:55.994 --> 00:03:00.609 line:88%
Bo‘sh stakan va idishni mehmon
so‘ramasidan oldin payqang.

40
00:03:01.959 --> 00:03:05.605 line:88%
Uchinchi vaziyat: mehmon chegirma so‘radi.

41
00:03:05.825 --> 00:03:09.531 line:88%
— Men doimiy mijozman.
Chegirma qilib bering!

42
00:03:09.751 --> 00:03:14.245 line:88%
Chegirma — ofitsiantning
vakolatida emas. Va’da bermang.

43
00:03:14.465 --> 00:03:19.625 line:88%
— Tushundim. Bu masalani administrator
hal qiladi — hozir chaqiraman.

44
00:03:19.845 --> 00:03:24.763 line:88%
Mas’ulga ayting: qaysi stol, nima
bo‘ldi, mehmon nima kutyapti.

45
00:03:26.113 --> 00:03:30.486 line:88%
O‘zingiz hal qilasiz: pribor,
uzr, hisobni tekshirish.

46
00:03:30.706 --> 00:03:35.018 line:88%
Mas’ulga yetkazasiz: chegirma,
allergiya, xavfsizlik.

47
00:03:35.238 --> 00:03:38.944 line:88%
«Bilmayman» emas — «Hozir aniqlab beraman».

48
00:03:40.294 --> 00:03:44.606 line:88%
Oxirgi qadam — kuzatish.
Mehmon yakunni eslab qoladi.

49
00:03:44.826 --> 00:03:48.775 line:88%
— Rahmat, janob Karimov!
Hammasi ma’qul bo‘ldimi?

50
00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:51.395 line:88%
— Juda yaxshi, rahmat!

51
00:03:51.615 --> 00:03:55.260 line:88%
— Yana kutib qolamiz. Xayr, salomat bo‘ling!

52
00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:59.671 line:88%
Mehmon ketgach, stolni
tekshiring: buyum qolmadimi?

53
00:04:01.021 --> 00:04:06.061 line:88%
Takrorlaymiz: o‘ttiz soniyada
salom, halol vaqt, stolga kuzatish.

54
00:04:06.281 --> 00:04:11.199 line:88%
Ikki daqiqada tekshiruv, vakolat
chegarasi, samimiy xayrlashuv.

55
00:04:11.419 --> 00:04:16.155 line:88%
Keyingi mavzu — sanitariya va
xavfsiz xizmat. Ko‘rishguncha!
